Concatenate all levels

We repeat steps scale coordinate, Find the enclosing cell, Hash function, lookup table, Bilinear interpolation (inside the cell)
 for all L levels.

So we get:

f1​(x,y),f2(x,y),...,fL(x,y)

Each is size F.

We concatenate:

enc(x,y)∈RL⋅F

